      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IMA DESTROYER (1) had been building to a win and it arrived last start when she led all the way to score as the $1.85 favourite over 2230m at this track, getting home by 4 metres. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Her recent effort is good enough to win a race of this calibre. STAR OF PATRICK (2) was out of the money two starts ago then things went wrong last start when he copped a check, broke, and finished a distant sixth over 2230m at this track. Has the benefit of a good draw this time. Won't find this any harder so he can return to form. MAJESTIC SUMMER (6) was responsible for a better effort last time out when third over 2230m at this track after racing in behind the leader at the bell. Should run a big race. FEEL THE MOMENT (3) is the best of the rest after finishing third to the top selection over 2230m at this track last time out after racing three back on the fence at the bell.",
